flowchart LR
    A[Define test requirements] --> B[Capture and validate evidence]
    B --> C[Calculate metrics in Python]
    C --> D[Compare configuration and conditions]
    D --> E{Required context complete?}
    E -->|No| F[Ask engineer; retain unknowns]
    E -->|Yes| G[Retrieve guidance and form hypotheses]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Validate sources and review report]
    H --> I[Engineer reviews support draft]
    I -->|Approve exact revision| J[Create local ticket]
    J -. Proposed next engineering step .-> K[Approved comparable retest]
